  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A first-of-its-kind waterless liquid bronzer with 70% skincare ingredients. Its serum-like texture melts into skin for 12 hours of sheer warmth.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage:</strong> Medium</p><p><br><strong>Finish: </strong>Natural</p><p><br><strong>Formulation: </strong>Liquid</p><p><br><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong><br>- Wakame Extract: A marine algae known to strengthen the skin barrier to protect against environmental aggressors and maintain hydration.</p><p>- Coastal Succulent Extract: Boosts hydration from inside out for smoother skin.</p><p>- Hyaluronic Filling Spheres: Provide a smooth, hydrated, and youthful appearance.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p>-A little goes a long way. On bare skin or over makeup, tap a few small dots onto the high points of your face where the sun naturally hits: cheeks, forehead, and the end of the nose.&nbsp;</p><p>-Blend with a full-bodied brush like the Dual-Ended Multi-Purpose Brush to diffuse into Skin.</p><p>-Layer to build warmth.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Wakame Extract: A marine algae known to strengthen the skin barrier to protect against environmental aggressors and maintain hydration.<br>-Coastal Succulent Extract: Boosts hydration from inside out for smoother skin.<br>-Hyaluronic Filling Spheres: Provide a smooth, hydrated, and youthful appearance.<br><br>Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Octyldodecanol, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Isododecane, Hydrogenated Poly(C6-14 Olefin), Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Hydrogenated Styrene/Isoprene Copolymer, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Phenyl Trimethicone, Acrylates/Dimethicone Copolymer, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Sodium Hyaluronate, Undaria Pinnatifida Extract, Arnica Montana Flower Extract (Fermented), Squalane, Pistacia Lentiscus (Mastic) Gum, Salicornia Herbacea Extract, Pseudozyma Epicola/Sunflower Seed Oil Ferment Extract Filtrate, Pseudozyma Epicola/Camellia Sinensis Seed Oil Ferment Extract Filtrate, Pseudozyma Epicola/Apricot Kernel Oil/Olive Fruit Oil/Sweet Almond Oil/Sunflower Seed Oil/Licorice Root Extract Ferment Extract Filtrate, Pseudozyma Epicola/Apricot Kernel Oil/Olive Fruit Oil/Sunflower Seed Oil/Sweet Almond Oil/(Angelica Gigas/Lithospermum Erythrorhizon) Root Extract Ferment Extract Filtrate, Tocopherol, Stearyl Heptanoate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Stearyl Caprylate, Propylene Carbonate, Benzotriazolyl Dodecyl P-Cresol, Tocopheryl Acetate, Trihydroxystearin, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-Di-T-Butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide), CI 77491/77492/77499 (Iron Oxides), CI 15850 (Red 7).<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A first-of-its-kind waterless liquid bronzer with 70% skincare ingredients. Its serum-like texture melts into skin for 12 hours of sheer warmth.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage:</strong> Medium</p><p><br><strong>Finish: </strong>Natural</p><p><br><strong>Formulation: </strong>Liquid</p><p><br><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong><br>- Wakame Extract: A marine algae known to strengthen the skin barrier to protect against environmental aggressors and maintain hydration.</p><p>- Coastal Succulent Extract: Boosts hydration from inside out for smoother skin.</p><p>- Hyaluronic Filling Spheres: Provide a smooth, hydrated, and youthful appearance.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=